# Implementation Plan: Pre-Deployment Production Readiness & Render Compatibility

This implementation plan details each problem identified during the production audit and provides the exact, targeted solution to ensure Qualiva deploys cleanly and runs reliably on Render without unexpected crashes or regressions.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **No Business Logic or UI Changes**: These changes are strictly infrastructure, networking, and deployment configuration hardening. None of your application workflows, authentication logic, or UI designs are altered.

> [!TIP]
> A `render.yaml` Blueprint will be included in the repository root to enable clean 1-click infrastructure deployment on Render for both the Frontend and Backend services simultaneously.

