### 3. `VITE_API_URL` Missing Trailing `/api/v1` Normalization (HIGH)

#### Problem
In [`client/src/services/api.js:4-6`](file:///c:/Users/Ashwin/Desktop/LMS/client/src/services/api.js#L4-L6):
```javascript
const API_BASE_URL = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL
  ? import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')
  : '/api/v1';
```
If an administrator configures `VITE_API_URL=https://qualiva-backend.onrender.com` in Render's dashboard (omitting the `/api/v1` path), all API calls (e.g. `api.get('/auth/me')`) resolve to `https://qualiva-backend.onrender.com/auth/me` and fail with HTTP `404 Not Found`.

#### Solution
Normalize `API_BASE_URL` in [`client/src/services/api.js`](file:///c:/Users/Ashwin/Desktop/LMS/client/src/services/api.js) so that if `cleanUrl` does not already end with `/api/v1`, it automatically appends `/api/v1`:
```javascript
const rawApiUrl = import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL || '';
const cleanUrl = rawApiUrl.replace(/\/$/, '');
const API_BASE_URL = cleanUrl
  ? (cleanUrl.endsWith('/api/v1') ? cleanUrl : `${cleanUrl}/api/v1`)
  : '/api/v1';
```

